{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pneuma is a single-player hack-and-slash adventure that throws you into the role of Zoe, who is on a mission to reclaim what was stolen from her \u2013 the very fragments of her soul. Standing in her way are the Seven Deadly Sins themselves, each guarded by relentless hordes of skeletons and demons determined to see her fail. Every battle pushes Zoe closer to her ultimate goal, regaining her full strength and claiming her destined place as the new embodiment of Death. Fast-paced combat, brutal enemies, and high-stakes boss fights\u00a0 will test your skill, timing, and strategy as you carve your way through a world covered in darkness and corruption.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979380?t=1762309057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979380?t=1762309057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979380/619be0b10742f082065b5ec29871ca8186af67ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762309057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979380/619be0b10742f082065b5ec29871ca8186af67ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762309057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence occurs,  General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pneuma is a single-player hack-and-slash adventure that throws you into the role of Zoe, who is on a mission to reclaim what was stolen from her \u2013 the very fragments of her soul. Standing in her way are the Seven Deadly Sin